#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:4
msgid "v2.4.1"
msgstr "v2.4.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.4.1 is a small maintenance release: it adds ``b_and()`` / ``b_or()`` / "
"``b_nand()`` / ``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` aliases for the "
"binary image operations and applies USB-MSC (SCSI layer) and Kanji fixes "
"from MicroPython upstream. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — "
"v2.4.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v2.4.1 je malo izdanje za održavanje: dodaje aliase ``b_and()`` / ``b_or()``"
" / ``b_nand()`` / ``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` za binarne "
"operacije nad slikom te primjenjuje ispravke USB-MSC (SCSI sloj) i Kanjija "
"iz uzvodnog MicroPythona. Ne uvodi **nikakve promjene API-ja koje narušavaju"
" kompatibilnost** — skripte za v2.4.0 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Binary-op aliases** — added ``b_and()`` / ``b_or()`` / ``b_nand()`` / "
"``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` (the existing ``and()`` / ``or()`` "
"/ … names still work)."
msgstr ""
"**Aliasi binarnih operacija** — dodani ``b_and()`` / ``b_or()`` / "
"``b_nand()`` / ``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` (postojeći nazivi "
"``and()`` / ``or()`` / … i dalje rade)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Upstream fixes** — USB MSC (SCSI layer) and Kanji fixes from MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"**Uzvodni ispravci** — ispravci USB MSC (SCSI sloj) i Kanjija iz "
"MicroPythona."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:24
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v2.4.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nema promjena API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — ponovno flashajte "
"i vaše skripte za v2.4.0 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:28
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:30
msgid ""
"Added ``b_and()`` / ``b_nand()`` / ``b_or()`` / ``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / "
"``b_xnor()`` method names for the binary image operations as clearer "
"aliases; the original ``and()`` / ``nand()`` / ``or()`` / ``nor()`` / "
"``xor()`` / ``xnor()`` names continue to work. Updated the binary-ops "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Dodani nazivi metoda ``b_and()`` / ``b_nand()`` / ``b_or()`` / ``b_nor()`` /"
" ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` za binarne operacije nad slikom kao jasniji "
"aliasi; izvorni nazivi ``and()`` / ``nand()`` / ``or()`` / ``nor()`` / "
"``xor()`` / ``xnor()`` i dalje rade. Ažurirana je dokumentacija binarnih "
"operacija."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:37
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci pogrešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:39
msgid ""
"Applied the USB mass-storage SCSI-layer fix and the Kanji fix from "
"MicroPython upstream."
msgstr ""
"Primijenjen je ispravak SCSI sloja USB masovne pohrane i ispravak Kanjija iz"
" uzvodnog MicroPythona."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:43
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:45
msgid ""
"v2.4.1 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v2.4.0 run unchanged on v2.4.1 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v2.4.1 ne uvodi **nikakve promjene Python API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v2.4.0 rade nepromijenjene na"
" v2.4.1 — samo ponovno flashajte ugrađeni program (firmware)."
